# User-Unit: ~/.config/systemd/user/hsh-mcp.service — systemctl --user enable --now hsh-mcp
# Pfade auf die eigene Installation anpassen; Laufzeitdaten per RAGHSH_VAR umlenkbar.
[Unit]
Description=HsH RAG MCP Server (Streamable HTTP, Port 8765)
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
WorkingDirectory=%h/RAGHSH
# Environment=RAGHSH_VAR=/srv/raghsh
ExecStart=%h/RAGHSH/.venv/bin/python -m raghsh.server
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=10
TimeoutStartSec=120

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
